    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520310/extras/af2791f9cf01fe89e6760016a10d8260.avif?t=1748921324\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've spent years building the hardest Futanari deck to get your hands on\u2026 and now it\u2019s gone!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone had the audacity to <strong>hide your precious cards</strong> in the tightest corners of the house \u2014 and only you can stick your nose where it counts to get them back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore fully interactive 3D rooms</strong>, digging into even the most suspicious holes.<br>Under the bed, inside the closet, behind that perfectly placed bookshelf\u2026 the cards could be stuffed anywhere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recover each card</strong> and unlock teasing illustrations that'll make your deck stand tall with pride.<br>Get ready for a naughty hunt full of hard-to-ignore surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520310/extras/166791e1d450e7b89f78def0ecc735bc.avif?t=1748921324\" width=600 height=99 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Sensual cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Interactive rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with one hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520310/extras/af2791f9cf01fe89e6760016a10d8260.avif?t=1748921324\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've spent years building the hardest Futanari deck to get your hands on\u2026 and now it\u2019s gone!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone had the audacity to <strong>hide your precious cards</strong> in the tightest corners of the house \u2014 and only you can stick your nose where it counts to get them back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore fully interactive 3D rooms</strong>, digging into even the most suspicious holes.<br>Under the bed, inside the closet, behind that perfectly placed bookshelf\u2026 the cards could be stuffed anywhere!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recover each card</strong> and unlock teasing illustrations that'll make your deck stand tall with pride.<br>Get ready for a naughty hunt full of hard-to-ignore surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520310/extras/166791e1d450e7b89f78def0ecc735bc.avif?t=1748921324\" width=600 height=99 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Sensual cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Interactive rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with one hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul>",
